1
00:00:01,126 --> 00:00:02,627
You got famous
off the hype, too.

2
00:00:03,211 --> 00:00:04,546
The dream guy, huh?

3
00:00:05,755 --> 00:00:07,507
Music alone
wouldn't make you famous!

4
00:00:14,973 --> 00:00:16,474
You want clout?

5
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,521
You want clout, huh?

6
00:00:21,521 --> 00:00:22,731
I'll give you that.

7
00:00:31,406 --> 00:00:32,198
Henry,

8
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:36,286
see if we can re-edit
what we've got,

9
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:38,747
so Phil and January
aren't so obviously

10
00:00:38,747 --> 00:00:40,665
being paired up.

11
00:00:41,374 --> 00:00:43,251
If Phil quits,

12
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:44,627
we're screwed.

13
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:46,629
And please

14
00:00:47,172 --> 00:00:49,049
draft a PR statement ASAP.

15
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:50,592
Candy,

16
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:52,719
check our talent list.

17
00:00:53,803 --> 00:00:56,556
Reach out to everyone
on our shortlist.

18
00:00:56,556 --> 00:00:57,724
Contact them.

19
00:01:04,750 --> 00:01:05,416
Cole,

20
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:09,083
I'm sorry.

21
00:01:41,893 --> 00:01:43,186
Do you own this place?

22
00:01:43,186 --> 00:01:44,687
Why are you still here?

23
00:01:53,154 --> 00:01:54,572
Candy's.

24
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,713
The first time
I worked late,

25
00:02:11,756 --> 00:02:13,508
I was so busy
I forgot to eat.

26
00:02:14,384 --> 00:02:16,010
I ended up
in the hospital.

27
00:02:18,304 --> 00:02:19,597
Back then,

28
00:02:20,515 --> 00:02:22,016
I worked my ass off.

29
00:02:23,351 --> 00:02:25,436
But nothing I did
was good enough.

30
00:02:26,896 --> 00:02:28,982
It took me three years

31
00:02:29,357 --> 00:02:30,650
to finally get it right.

32
00:02:37,157 --> 00:02:38,074
I think

33
00:02:39,075 --> 00:02:40,910
it'll take me six years.

34
00:02:41,619 --> 00:02:42,787
No way.

35
00:02:43,371 --> 00:02:45,540
You've been here
less than a month

36
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:47,667
and you're already
doing great.

37
00:02:47,667 --> 00:02:48,501
Really?

38
00:02:48,501 --> 00:02:49,252
Yeah.

39
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:51,921
You're so busy

40
00:02:52,589 --> 00:02:54,090
and you still noticed me?

41
00:03:03,391 --> 00:03:04,684
That means a lot.

42
00:03:09,189 --> 00:03:10,190
Eat up.

43
00:03:10,940 --> 00:03:12,233
Then go home.

44
00:03:14,110 --> 00:03:15,987
But the statement...

45
00:03:15,987 --> 00:03:17,780
I'm not done yet.

46
00:03:17,780 --> 00:03:19,657
Work never ends.

47
00:03:28,291 --> 00:03:29,876
If you want,

48
00:03:34,172 --> 00:03:36,424
I'll come up with
more ideas tomorrow.

49
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:50,063
Yes, ma'am.

50
00:04:15,546 --> 00:04:16,589
What?

51
00:04:23,721 --> 00:04:25,265
You eat like...

52
00:04:25,932 --> 00:04:27,100
a little puppy.

53
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,362
I've always been

54
00:07:31,659 --> 00:07:33,494
afraid of love

55
00:07:41,169 --> 00:07:42,503
until

56
00:07:47,884 --> 00:07:50,094
someone came along
with a key

57
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:54,056
and unlocked my heart.

58
00:08:05,026 --> 00:08:06,319
They saw

59
00:08:14,660 --> 00:08:16,329
every secret

60
00:08:25,750 --> 00:08:27,791
I'd been hiding.

61
00:08:56,541 --> 00:08:58,333
That's when I realized

62
00:09:04,625 --> 00:09:06,416
I loved so fiercely

63
00:09:11,875 --> 00:09:13,916
because I wanted
to be loved.
